    gui_vulkan_window_blank_wsi_capture_2026-08-19, 1, "2026-11-13: Blocked on this host: check-gui-vulkan-window.shs needs Xvfb and a gui-feature seed; this host has xwd but no Xvfb or xvfb-run, and the gate app examples/06_io/ui/widget_showcase_gui.spl is owned by another lane today. Source note: present=false in the renderer line is static metadata (BackendProbeResult.has_present is never set for Vulkan in backend_probe.spl), not a symptom."

